  "post_content": "<p>El alumnado del colegio Mestre Caballero ha mostrado esta tarde en el gimnasio del centro una exhibici&oacute;n de las actividades extraescolares que han realizado durante el curso, organizadas por el AMPA y gestionadas por la empresa de animaci&oacute;n ondense Animatrix. Adem&aacute;s del baile moderno, al que pertenecen las fotos, tambi&eacute;n ha habido gimnasia art&iacute;stica y patinaje.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8632.jpg\" alt=\"img_8632\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8633.jpg\" alt=\"img_8633\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8634.jpg\" alt=\"img_8634\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8635.jpg\" alt=\"img_8635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8636.jpg\" alt=\"img_8636\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8637.jpg\" alt=\"img_8637\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8638.jpg\" alt=\"img_8638\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8639.jpg\" alt=\"img_8639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mestrecaballeromostraextraescolars/img_8640.jpg\" alt=\"img_8640\" s